<title>BELGIUM: Belgian company investment up 17.6% yr/yr in July.</title>
<headline>Belgian company investment up 17.6% yr/yr in July.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's National Statistics Institute (NSI) released the following data on corporate investment, calculated from VAT returns, for July -</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     July 1996  June 1996  July 1995</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1985)  176.7	  226.2     150.2</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	  17.6	    9.9</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     Jan-July period    Jan-June period</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	   6.8			5.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Non-industrial investments rose 15.0 percent in the first seven months, industrial investments rose 12.3 percent.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
